{"completed": true, "response": "条目数按可独立传达的正文句意或短条，以及单独的「←／⟲」注释行粗略估算；图A的长段落按其中的独立句意拆算。评分以原稿为准，尤其看心理变化是否有明确前因、箭头是否真的建立因果，以及最终能否直接用于视频。\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ranking\": [\"图B\", \"图A\", \"图C\"],\n  \"graphs\": {\n    \"图A\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 7,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 9,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 6,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 7,\n      \"words\": 6,\n      \"glance\": 5,\n      \"items_now\": 122,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 88,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"「自在地关心、给予……不失从容……更自在」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"「有时甚至比先前更自在」\",\n          \"type\": \"可省细节\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 动摇：（4–16）「这样已经足够」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 动摇：（4–16）「不必时时确认心意是否被领受」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"40–50\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（17–23）「希望它能长久」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"62–71\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 动摇：（1–3）「本能地往回收」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"84–92\",\n          \"quote\": \"「愿望此刻仿佛都能与喜欢同在、得到伸展的余地」\",\n          \"type\": \"抽象词\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"93–102\",\n          \"quote\": \"「想让心里积攒的温柔全都有所归属」\",\n          \"type\": \"抽象词\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"103–110\",\n          \"quote\": \"「两种心思都没有退让」……「更强烈地感觉到它们的冲突」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（1–3）「还说不清自己究竟盼什么」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"多条「←说明／←改写」反复指向（103–110）及（1–3）\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7.4,\n      \"verdict\": \"原稿的主要心理推进基本保留，历史意识也较强；但大段落塞进太多不同意思，回溯箭头又有主题代替因果的情况。适合作为内容底稿，尚不是一眼能读懂的成品Thread。\"\n    },\n    \"图B\": {\n      \"why_now\": 9,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 8,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 7,\n      \"faithful\": 9,\n      \"standalone\": 9,\n      \"efficiency\": 6,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 7,\n      \"items_now\": 118,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 94,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（1–3）「无事待决仍谨慎」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"「不一定带来不安……不失从容，反而比先前更自在」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 动摇：（4–16）「自然亲近便已足够」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"24–34\",\n          \"quote\": \"「更愿意付出」……「不再小心衡量」……「充实自由」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"40–50\",\n          \"quote\": \"「暂时忘了自己为何在意回应」\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"72–77\",\n          \"quote\": \"「欢喜稍落定后……也想让深情得到回应」✦ 满足照出未满足\",\n          \"type\": \"标签贴错\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"93–102\",\n          \"quote\": \"「仿佛无须再增加什么」……「所有心愿都已得到抒发」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"103–110\",\n          \"quote\": \"「两股心思都没有退让」……「更强烈地感到冲突」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他愿继续把对方放在心里」……「他可以渴望被爱」……「他没有得到想要的一切」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7.8,\n      \"verdict\": \"三张中因果链最清楚，绝大部分推进都有原稿依据，单条也容易独立理解。主要问题是个别历史箭头只表示对照，以及若干相邻条目重复表达充实、冲突和最终选择；删掉约两成冗余后最适合交给视频制作。\"\n    },\n    \"图C\": {\n      \"why_now\": 8,\n      \"center\": 8,\n      \"history_connection\": 6,\n      \"insight\": 8,\n      \"accumulation\": 8,\n      \"faithful\": 7,\n      \"standalone\": 8,\n      \"efficiency\": 7,\n      \"alive_concrete\": 8,\n      \"words\": 7,\n      \"glance\": 8,\n      \"items_now\": 128,\n      \"items_if_trimmed\": 92,\n      \"problems\": [\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他决定先不替这份喜欢安排去向」\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（1–3）「本能地收住喜欢」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"4–16\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 唤起：（1–3）「舍不得放下那点喜欢」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（4–16）「亲近对方却不急问以后」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"17–23\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（4–16）「自在地给予对方温柔」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"35–39\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 限制与 ← 唤起都指向（24–34）「以为不索求就不会失去」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"40–50\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（24–34）「从关心给予中找到快乐」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"51–61\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 提供理由：（40–50）「不再用甜意衡量关系」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"62–71\",\n          \"quote\": \"「决定尽情喜欢一次」\",\n          \"type\": \"编造\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"62–71\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（51–61）「独自容纳无着落的盼望」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"72–77\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（1–3）「本能地收住喜欢」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"78–83\",\n          \"quote\": \"← 改写：（35–39）「暂留疑问与不自在」\",\n          \"type\": \"箭头牵强\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"103–110\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他担心把安稳全交给对方，会让对方连他的全部不安也必须负责消除」\",\n          \"type\": \"丢了推进\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"seg\": \"111–116\",\n          \"quote\": \"「他愿继续把这个人放在心里」……「即使没有得到想要的一切」\",\n          \"type\": \"重复\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"overall\": 7.1,\n      \"verdict\": \"短条切分最清楚，心理积累的标记也较完整，扫读体验最好；但若干回溯箭头只是把相似的情绪或主题连在一起，不能证明前者导致后者。此外，把「不急着」改成「决定」加重了原稿的确定程度。需要先清理错误连接、恢复原稿的犹疑，再考虑视觉定稿。\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "73879097-0590-4849-a4f3-cd3c8eb73a75", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261022T012314686540Z", "elapsed_seconds": 339.172, "completed_utc": "2026-10-22T01:28:53.870718+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "03854d175ea3c7381ef722ba00a2f50da3e45248412d37afbafec6ba9527cb91", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete"